# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout. Without this, a Windows clone rewrites every
# file to CRLF, and the next commit from a Linux machine shows all 137 files as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures and archives are bytes. IFC is text, but line-ending translation would change a file
# whose checksum an ICDD container may be asserting.
*.ifc  -text
*.zip  binary
*.png  binary
*.whl  binary
